WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:42.280
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:49.920
<i>Taichi and the Chosen Ones with their
partner Digimon continue their journey</i>

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:54.730
<i>to prevent the revival of the bringer
of destruction and darkness, Millenniumon.</i>

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:59.550
<i>And they head toward
the Sealed Grounds, FAGA.</i>

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:04.560
<i>Fighting alongside Takeru,</i>

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:09.690
<i>Patamon builds power as the Holy Digimon
to save the world.</i>

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:17.400
<i>Now, the two are
about to be put to the test...</i>

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.080
It's shaking a lot.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.000
It's so bumpy!

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:30.130
I'm getting carsick...

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:32.380
No, Komondomon-sick.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:33.420
What?

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:35.220
Patamon, are you okay?

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:36.090
Yeah!

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.800
Joe, you don't look so good.

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.720
Ugh, I'm oka...

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:43.350
No!

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.980
Why don't you look at the scenery?

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:48.770
Uh-huh! You'll feel much better!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:50.980
I-I'll do that...

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:03.240
Unfortunate weather,
but there's a very beautiful moon out.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:07.040
Although, it's kind of green...

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.250
What?!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.750
THE SWORD OF HOPE

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:20.510
Sephirothmon No. 6
is now returning to make a report.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.260
"Found the Chosen Ones.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:27.770
They will likely reach FAGA."

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:32.400
Commence Forced Data Collection Mode.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.150
Commence.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.400
Commence.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.320
There's nothing around.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.040
That's weird.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:51.040
I'm sure I saw a round green thing.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.960
Maybe you saw something else?

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.210
No, I really saw it!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.960
Uh, but I'm a little unsure now...

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.750
Th-That! That thing!

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:09.260
Everyone, get inside Komondomon!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.670
Taichi!

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:34.210
Hikari!

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.310
Y-You're heavy...

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:45.680
Sorry.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:47.140
Oww...

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.180
Takeru.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:50.310
You okay?

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:51.350
Yeah.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:52.930
And Patamon?

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.940
I'm okay...

00:04:58.730 --> 00:04:59.940
Koshiro...

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:05.450
Looks like this is a separate space
that is located within that sphere.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.920
Taichi! Taichi, do you hear me?!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:21.050
Yamato! Koshiro-kun! Please answer me!

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:24.180
Jeez, what is that?!

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:25.680
Sephirothmon.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.970
SEPHIROTHMON

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:30.390
That Digimon's body is composed
of ten spheres and that's one of them.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.600
What happened to Taichi and everybody?

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.850
They got eaten, right?!

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.310
By the eyes.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.270
They're probably still okay.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:47.280
<i>Sephirothmon first traps Digimon
inside that spherical body.</i>

00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.630
Agumon!

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.760
Wasn't that...

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.930
I think that was Snimon.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.270
Coelamon?!

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.430
Petit Fire!

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:26.030
And also Dokugumon?!

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.240
But there's something weird about them!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.410
We're surrounded...

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:44.960
Tankmon!

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.590
And even Tylomon!

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:52.430
<i>Sephirothmon forces you to fight
until you collapse</i>

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:55.430
<i>and takes the battle data
from all the Digimon inside.</i>

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.230
That is how Sephirothmon eats!

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.480
What do you mean fight?

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:06.570
<i>Sephirothmon only watches.</i>

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:11.490
<i>Copies are created from the battle memory
etched within the trapped Digimon.</i>

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.740
<i>And these copies attack the prey.</i>

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:19.000
Those are created from
the collection of remaining data.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:22.500
They are between a real entity
and a virtual image.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:25.420
It seems they're different
from real Digimon.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:31.310
So to sum it up,
they're just poorly-made fakes.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.060
But these numbers,
we can't let our guard down.

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:36.480
Let's just get out of here!

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:37.430
Yeah!

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.060
Agumon Evolution!

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:41.610
Gabumon Evolution!

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:43.440
Tentomon Evolution!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.440
Greymon!

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.440
Garurumon!

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:52.450
Kabuterimon!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:53.540
Patamon!

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.910
Patamon Evolution!

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:57.950
Angemon!

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.960
Mega Flame!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.920
Fox Fire!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.800
Mega Blaster!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.190
Orgemon!

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:42.870
Greymon!

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:49.630
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:00.060
Metalgreymon!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.320
Garurumon!

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:17.820
Garurumon Super Evolution!

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:25.500
Weregarurumon!

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:31.460
It's hard to tell if they're tough or not!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.260
Oh, I remember you!

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:41.850
Kabuterimon!

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:46.020
Kabuterimon Super Evolution!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:49.480
Atlurkabuterimon!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:12.090
Sephirothmon scatters
across the continent from FAGA

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:16.050
and goes around collecting
powerful Digimon's data.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:19.300
All to revive Millenniumon!

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:25.310
<i>It's a different scheme than the one
Hikari and I were once involved in.</i>

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:30.940
<i>Its purpose is to create the ultimate body
from fusing all sorts of Digimon's data.</i>

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.030
<i>The accumulated data within Sephirothmon</i>

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:37.450
<i>will eventually gather at FAGA
and become one.</i>

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:41.120
Then Sephirothmon attacked us to...

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:45.620
"Finish off the enemy
and take their data while at it!"

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.250
That must be their plan.

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:21.580
Takeru, are you hurt?

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:24.070
I'm okay. Thank you, Angemon.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:25.950
And everyone else?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.530
Even Devimon...

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:08.490
My dear old friend...

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:19.340
There's something different
from the rest of the fakes.

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:23.340
You are cursed.

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:29.430
The name of that curse is the Chosen Ones.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.100
A curse?

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:39.610
The Holy Digimon... born with powers.

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:43.280
If you would forget your mission
and use those powers freely,

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:46.030
you could even take over the world.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.580
However, those powers and evolutions

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:53.630
are under the fate of being confined
by the existence known as humans.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:56.630
If that isn't a curse, then what is?

00:12:56.630 --> 00:13:00.840
Neither the children
nor Takeru is a curse!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.260
Angemon!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.640
Giga Storm!

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.980
There's no end to these guys!

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.860
They just keep coming!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.710
Takeru! Takeru!

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:38.920
Shadow Wing!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.050
Flower Canon!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.420
Hammer Spark!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:46.430
Heaven's Charm!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.930
Metalgreymon's Giga Storm?

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:00.230
Weregarurumon's Kaiser Nail?

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:03.940
Sephirothmon is beginning
to learn everyone's powers!

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:07.570
You mean this thing
gets stronger by the minute?!

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:11.500
I can't tell if we should
be fighting at full power.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.240
Is everyone inside okay?

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:25.460
Why is Devimon so fixated on Angemon?

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.110
Angemon!

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:51.200
Don't worry... I won't lose.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.370
I cannot afford to lose!

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:58.370
This is a battle between me and myself!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.290
Devimon...

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:07.010
Every time I clashed with you,
my faded memories gradually came back.

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:12.090
At the end of the ancient war...

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:16.850
<i>When I awoke after being heavily wounded,</i>

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:20.440
<i>I found myself swallowed
by a swamp of dark miasma.</i>

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:25.400
<i>Infested by darkness, my powers faded.</i>

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:28.280
<i>While in pain
for what felt like an eternity,</i>

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.410
<i>it was born in front of my eyes.</i>

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:34.530
<i>The devil with black wings.</i>

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.380
Come join the darkness.

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:41.170
That is your only salvation.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.840
You are my shadow!

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:50.670
My shadow reflected onto darkness!

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:55.930
A distortion born from my weakness.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:58.560
That is why you pursue power,

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.520
<i>and you were taken over by it...</i>

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.980
That is why you were destroyed!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:07.660
Wrong, I am indestructible.

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:11.740
As long as you live,
I will return endlessly.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:17.740
The rise in your power has granted me
a physical body once more!

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.870
Heaven's Knuckle!

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.840
I am the Holy Digimon!

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:34.430
The one to become
the world's hope with Takeru!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:41.930
I am indestructible...

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:46.320
Hope...

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:49.450
So that is what holds you back.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.940
If that is the case...

00:16:55.570 --> 00:17:01.330
I am indestructible...

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.080
Angemon!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.130
There is nothing to fear.

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:10.090
If you come join the darkness,
all your pain shall fade.

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:14.970
Angemon!

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:18.350
Take...

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:22.350
Now, put an end to that curse
known as the Chosen Ones

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.850
with your own hands.

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:30.990
That sin will crush
your heart and your hope.

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:36.240
Hope will disappear with
the Holy Digimon and you will be reborn.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:43.540
Reborn as the beautiful black wings
fallen to darkness,

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.000
a Digimon of darkness.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.250
Angemon...

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:08.400
Why do you not run?

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.530
Why do you not fear?

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:13.780
Angemon won't lose to someone like you!

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:25.540
That's why I won't lose either.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:28.130
I trust you...

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:29.580
Angemon!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.310
So do I...

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:44.600
No matter how deep I fall
into the darkness, if you're with me...

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:53.320
I can fly!

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:55.480
Angemon!

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:02.660
Shadow, let me tell you one thing.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.870
Just as how you are indestructible,

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:08.750
the light of hope
will never disappear as well!

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:27.640
Angemon Super Evolution!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.070
Holyangemon!

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:40.150
HOLYANGEMON

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.000
What?

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:00.800
H-Huh?

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.260
Where are we?

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.050
We're outside...

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.520
Taichi!

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.440
Thank goodness!

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:11.940
Hikari!

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.690
Is everyone okay?

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:14.940
Takeru...

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:40.590
Severe data damage.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:42.720
The plan needs adjustments.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:46.180
Beware of the Chosen Ones.

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:48.100
Beware.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:52.400
That's...

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:54.350
Holyangemon.

00:20:57.110 --> 00:21:00.360
<i>Just as myself, hope is indestructible.</i>

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:04.240
<i>Let us see if those words
are true or not...</i>

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:08.910
The answer lies beyond the path
that Takeru and I follow.

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:12.250
You just watch... old friend.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.380
No need to worry.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.390
Thank you, Takeru.

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:25.510
Thank you too, Holyangemon.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>The border has now begun to blend</i>

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>ima mazari atteku border</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>"It's uncharted territory from here!"</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>koko kara wa jinrui mitou desu!</i>

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<i>All that you desire awaits you</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<i>nozomu kagiri no subete ga aru kara</i>

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>The end doesn't exist, that's right</i>

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>owari nanka nai ze sou sa</i>

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>We're at our starting point right now</i>

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>koko wa ima bokura no shuppatsuten</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>There's a tomorrow that no one knows about</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>dare mo shiranai asu wa aru kara</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>So keep on smiling</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>waratte iyou</i>

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>We're past the point of stopping
In our daily lives</i>

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>imasara tachidomarenu bokura no
nichijou jou</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>Bring on the unknown!</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>michi joutou!</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>That day, I drew on the wall with you</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>ano hi kimi to kabe ni kaita</i>

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.190
<i>The incomplete, the imperfect</i>

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.190
<i>mikansei wo fukanzen wo</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>"You can't go anywhere at this point"</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>imasara doko e mo ikenai ze tte</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>Oh, is that so?! Oh, is that so?!</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>aa sou kai nee! aa sou kai nee!</i>

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>Then we don't want to become a grown-up</i>

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>nara otona ni nanka natcha ikenai nee</i>

00:22:31.240 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:36.040
<i>Holyangemon.</i>

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:38.460
<i>This Digimon super evolves from Angemon,</i>

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:38.460
LEVEL: ULTIMATE

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:40.920
TYPE: ARCHANGEL

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:42.290
<i>the angel of light who protects order
in the Digital World!</i>

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:43.340
SPECIAL MOVE: HEAVEN'S GATE

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:45.430
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.430 --> 00:22:48.390
